                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi ka fi ra yi tu jo uru pari yini adrizuri Ina alia; Petero pi Yohana pie, Yakobo pie, Andarea pie, Filipo pi Toma be, Baritolomayo pi Matayo be, Yakobo Alifayo mvi pi Simoni Zelote pie, Yudasi Yakobo mvi pie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
